      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "Select one of the following metamagic feats: Disrupting SpellAPG, Ectoplasmic SpellAPG, Furious SpellOA, Merciful SpellAPG, or Piercing SpellUM. By accepting 1 point of burn, you can alter your kinetic blast as if using the selected metamagic feat."
